      "id": "ev-51-monti-visit",
      "summary": "Luca visits the cultural literary café in Rione Monti and discovers the gritty operational reality behind its stylish public facade.",
      "characterIds": [
        "luca"
      ],
      "locationIds": [
        "quartiere",
        "centro",
        "strada"
      ],
      "rememberedFacts": [
        "Luca walks to Rione Monti on Saturday afternoon to visit Spazio & Caffè Monti",
        "The venue is stylish and crowded with artists and students, but the bar area is disorganized behind the counter",
        "Luca meets Matteo and his business partner Claudia, who is skeptical about hiring another barista",
        "Luca inspects the equipment and honestly points out technical and workflow flaws rather than offering flattery",
        "Matteo invites Luca to review the contract and numbers on Monday, warning that decisions will involve compromises"
      ]
    }
  ],
